<title>ITALY: Italy May PSBR 13.0 trillion lire-Treasury.</title>
<headline>Italy May PSBR 13.0 trillion lire-Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's public sector borrowing requirement was some 13.0 trillion lire in May 1997, up around six trillion lire on the same month last year, the Treasury Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the May 1996 figure included one-off gains.</p>
<p>The Treasury said the cumulative PSBR for the first five months of 1997 was 54.95 trillion lire, compared with 78.71 trillion lire for the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
